<article class="env-lemma" id="0BZS">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0BZS">Lemma <span data-tag="0BZS">47.24.6</span>.</a> Let $R \to R'$ be a homomorphism of Noetherian rings. Let $\varphi : R \to A$ be flat of finite type. Let $\varphi ' : R' \to A' = A \otimes _ R R'$ be the map induced by $\varphi $. Then we have a functorial isomorphism </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \varphi ^!(K) \otimes _ A^\mathbf {L} A' = (\varphi ')^!(K \otimes _ R^\mathbf {L} R')  \]
</div>
  <p> for $K$ in $D(R)$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Special case of Lemma <a href="/tag/0BZR" data-tag="0BZR">47.24.5</a> by More on Algebra, Lemma <a href="/tag/067J" data-tag="067J">15.84.4</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>